== Usage ==
When right-clicked in the player's hand, they are given the listed quantity of the [[Enchanted Book]]s the bundle contains. The bundle is consumed in the process.

== Bugs ==
*Opening an '''Enchanted Book Bundle''' in the [[Rift]] will cause the item to get wiped.

